{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_6000_situation", "source_sha256": "5c9045e1e774e8eb02e77c943c60b4742021ed6aa393d4c0de92ffe37951fe24", "ja": "雑誌の撮影", "zh": "杂志拍摄", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_6000_place", "source_sha256": "e9e8ffa1119a2236e349b9d9318ab4350bfa5d4f1df8bbd9db23e9f9958b252e", "ja": "お屋敷", "zh": "宅邸", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_6001_p", "source_sha256": "5da39ff693edf781af123618c14b23b8382bca68d3fb042c9ef934778cb47c04", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日だ。\n『童話のキツネ』をテーマに撮影するぞ）", "zh": "（今天是《偶像写真！！》杂志的拍摄日。\n要以“童话里的狐狸”为主题进行拍摄了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_6002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "62922f43b8fe9bdee2a809535b34ae402a5128f26abb0a531ab565ddbad32686", "ja": "{$P$}……\nお待たせしましたぁ～……うぅ。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n让您久等了～……呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_6003_p", "source_sha256": "90f0906972a0947daf836a1c438b07cafe0b68562e60e059d3dbee2083f2186d", "ja": "えっ？　雪歩？　どうした、何かあったのか？", "zh": "咦？雪步？怎么了，发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_6004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ebfbaed75d4d048490caf8185b7acec8b67fb366a174053194ec330944a3cb11", "ja": "はい……。着替えが終わって戻ろうとしたら、\n急に監督さんに呼び止められて……。", "zh": "是的……换好衣服正准备回去时，突然被导演叫住了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_6005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "1952cd7e71543da11deb8b72bf5e9bb662d41a7819eb671d5305abcee53e4c65", "ja": "今日の撮影の『童話のキツネ』のイメージは、\n私が自由に決めていいよって言われちゃったんです～！", "zh": "今天拍摄的《童话里的狐狸》形象，\n导演说可以让我自由决定～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_6006_p", "source_sha256": "613622532e0ac5d8228b1801fdc036351204988d018f37d5623b6e8a76acd6f2", "ja": "なんだ、いいことじゃないか。\nそれだけ雪歩を信頼してもらえてるって事だろ？", "zh": "这不是挺好的吗？这就说明人家很信任雪步吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_6007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "259d7342bc58a6388ef3d09bc8765e24a744aa08bc74669eb7190b318dbff060", "ja": "そ、そうなんでしょうか……。でも、\nキツネの出てくるお話っていっぱいあるから……。", "zh": "是、是这样的吗……可是，狐狸登场的故事有很多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_6008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e7d7dc0f30345f34567430541dd0338c0d3e8e8b8af94788e69aeda55574816a", "ja": "ううぅ、どんなキツネがいいのかなぁ……。\n{$P$}、助けてくださいぃ～～～！", "zh": "呜呜，到底选什么样的狐狸比较好呢……\n{$P$}，救救我呀～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_6009_p", "source_sha256": "5dedae0a504c833d2701f51de36134aae5e6a22bb37b32eddeffe0258510cda4", "ja": "（好みで良い気もするが、真剣に悩んでるみたいだな。\nそれなら、なにか少しでもヒントになるような……）", "zh": "（感觉按喜好选就行，不过她好像很认真地在烦恼。既然如此，得想点什么，哪怕能给她一点提示……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_6010", "source_sha256": "eaad2d9aed98f8b0bcd048c34655f57b2a7f3c9f14b2060f9f786d20e6cb6495", "ja": "お嫁さんキツネ", "zh": "新娘狐狸", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_6011", "source_sha256": "c014c20ed205dec44c2855189279e599446f6a579e46e4a1a494b13681faa30b", "ja": "恩返しキツネ", "zh": "报恩狐狸", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_6012", "source_sha256": "fe1e66a8f08ece6326726e41c25904d894d54677796c9a63e6c75d44a95f3702", "ja": "いたずらキツネ", "zh": "捣蛋狐狸", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_6100_p", "source_sha256": "497b00eddd7893fb4e50d903af3c109dae67659be403c990ab805288ebee9a1c", "ja": "たとえば……キツネのお嫁さんなんてどうかな？\n優しい雪歩のイメージにピッタリだと思うけど。", "zh": "比如……当一位狐狸新娘怎么样？\n我觉得这和温柔的雪步形象非常相配。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_6101_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0a2ae16b8a591765e63d6876e26ff97460752a853177f9a5dbe8c20607ec0967", "ja": "ええっ、お嫁さんですか？　えっと……。\n「あなた、お茶が入りましたよ。コンコン♪」……？", "zh": "诶，结婚对象吗？呃……  \n“亲爱的，茶泡好了哦。咚咚♪”……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_6102_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f0fb9c39a6d5f933c326b8da3818da1e285f6a1b3229e599441cc6dba1f22e82", "ja": "……あ、なんだか、イメージわいてきたかも。\n{$P$}、私、頑張ってみますぅ！", "zh": "……啊，总觉得，好像有点找到感觉了。\n{$P$}，我会努力试试看的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_6200_p", "source_sha256": "d590a2768aab9ef8bc83c7ff6f72a318b488e81226dcd6173ff37a31e293a7b5", "ja": "それなら……恩返しをするキツネなんてどうかな？\n色々な話に出てくるし、イメージしやすいかも。", "zh": "那样的话……要不要试试会报恩的狐狸？  \n这种狐狸在各种故事里都会出现，可能更容易联想到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_6201_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c0db4894d6120d21e36ddcde746af1397c43d8d4e2a094894348e9e444b7aec7", "ja": "あ！　たしかに、私が子どもの頃読んだ本にも、\nそういうキツネが出てくるお話があった気がしますぅ。", "zh": "啊！确实，我小时候看过的书里，\n好像也有这种狐狸出场的故事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_6202_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9de630e6806662e392166a64bae44f62ba349ab1c8574502ccba99b51e48be4a", "ja": "「あの時助けていただいたキツネです。この扉は決して\n開けないで……」あ、あれ？　なんか違うような……？", "zh": "“我是那只曾受您相救的狐狸。请千万不要打开这扇门……”啊、咦？总觉得好像哪里不对……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_6300_p", "source_sha256": "d87051cc6a6ffbaa3c22dd26f343281264093dd9fa4f5b2875f8842ba5dec643", "ja": "やっぱり……キツネは人を化かすイメージがあるし、\n元気いっぱいのいたずらキツネなんていいかもな。", "zh": "果然还是……狐狸总给人一种会捉弄人的印象，\n演个活力满满的恶作剧狐狸也许不错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_6301_004yuk", "source_sha256": "450141d0c3b3f13b7ab049e1cc730960c14891be04643779a6737d1a0101893b", "ja": "げ、元気いっぱいの……？　えっと……。\n「ガハハ！　オレサマいたずらキツネだあー！」……。", "zh": "精、精神饱满的……？那个……\n“嘎哈哈！本大爷是精力十足的淘气狐狸——！”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_6302_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c35c443a10a74580849817a9dcbfabf55e6d4871702355795bb3578945081ccd", "ja": "うう、他の子ならもっとうまくできるんだろうな……。\nなんだかどんどん、自信がなくなってきましたぁ……。", "zh": "呜呜，要是换成其他人的话，肯定能做得更好吧……  \n总觉得越来越没有自信了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
